    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The [`vDSP_hamm_window`](vdsp_hamm_window.md) and [`vDSP_hamm_windowD`](vdsp_hamm_windowd.md) functions create a Hamming window vector using the following operation:",
      "ko": "The [`vDSP_hamm_window`](vdsp_hamm_window.md) and [`vDSP_hamm_windowD`](vdsp_hamm_windowd.md) functions create a Hamming window vector using the following operation:",
      "sourceHash": "879ec52cc52f459152830d5d891c86b0e5cdbba62e310d40855da07ec270c6fd",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "```objc\nfor (n=0; n < N; ++n)\n{\n    C[n] = 0.54 - (0.46 * cos( 2 * pi * n / N ) );\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```objc\nfor (n=0; n < N; ++n)\n{\n    C[n] = 0.54 - (0.46 * cos( 2 * pi * n / N ) );\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "8ecd2efc514f86e9891040169524e0de50fa32d001c235120ae59055b7f816d1",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "The following code shows how to generate a Hamming window:",
      "ko": "The following code shows how to generate a Hamming window:",
      "sourceHash": "8e73dfd04db17b519257ce1c159ab18dd0e0ff2b7f6f6f4940e9583e7840b566",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nlet n = vDSP_Length(1024)\n\nvar c = [Float](repeating: 0,\n                count: Int(n))\n\nvDSP_hamm_window(&c,\n                 n,\n                 0)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet n = vDSP_Length(1024)\n\nvar c = [Float](repeating: 0,\n                count: Int(n))\n\nvDSP_hamm_window(&c,\n                 n,\n                 0)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "8a23d698dada34be460316fb9b138775cd40c83e25b8367ce64e2d3c2a2d10a2",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
